WEBVTT

00:00:00.469 --> 00:00:05.165
Welcome to Alaventra. Rank in
search. Get recommended by AI.

00:00:06.143 --> 00:00:11.074
In tutorial 9.5, you'll review and
approve your pitches before they go out.

00:00:12.185 --> 00:00:16.310
First, open Link building. The
top shows what needs you next,

00:00:16.360 --> 00:00:18.603
and how many pitches wait for your review.

00:00:19.630 --> 00:00:24.300
Scroll to Ready to send. Each card
shows why the site is worth asking,

00:00:24.350 --> 00:00:27.024
the page you'd like linked,
and who you'll write to.

00:00:27.984 --> 00:00:32.424
Click Review & approve. You see who it
goes to, the mailbox it's sent from,

00:00:32.474 --> 00:00:33.752
and the first e-mail.

00:00:35.488 --> 00:00:38.638
Edit the subject and the
text in your own words.

00:00:38.688 --> 00:00:41.788
The hints below each one show
the length that works best.

00:00:43.467 --> 00:00:49.192
Below, two short follow-ups wait in the
same thread, sent only if there's no reply.

00:00:49.242 --> 00:00:52.227
Your signature and postal
address are added for you.

00:00:53.226 --> 00:00:56.311
Some recipients need
consent first, by law.

00:00:56.361 --> 00:01:00.521
Tick I have their consent or we already
work together, only when it's true.

00:01:01.701 --> 00:01:03.976
Then click Approve and schedule.

00:01:04.026 --> 00:01:08.726
It goes out from your mailbox in your
sending window, and stops at the first reply.

00:01:09.747 --> 00:01:13.363
Not right for you? Click Not a
fit, and the site is left out.

00:01:15.747 --> 00:01:20.437
Finally, in Settings, choose Approve
each, so someone reads every pitch first.

00:01:20.487 --> 00:01:21.785
Or pick Automatic.

00:01:22.744 --> 00:01:28.144
With Automatic, nobody reads those e-mails
first, so only the owner can turn it on.

00:01:28.194 --> 00:01:30.946
Set the most a day, then
click Save settings.

00:01:31.931 --> 00:01:35.706
Every pitch you approve goes out
from your own address, a few a day,

00:01:35.756 --> 00:01:37.399
and you keep the final say.

00:01:38.931 --> 00:01:40.606
Want new openings sooner?

00:01:40.656 --> 00:01:44.698
Find opportunities now runs this
website's weekly search right away.

00:01:45.706 --> 00:01:50.241
So, open Link building, read and
edit a pitch, confirm consent,

00:01:50.291 --> 00:01:53.833
approve it or mark it not a fit,
and choose how approvals work.

00:01:54.856 --> 00:01:59.740
Next, answer replies and follow
your pitches, in tutorial 9.6.
